!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/invalid/an-untagged-value-at-an-extern-of-a-choice-not-disjoint-needs-the-tag-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.9"
  description: """
    `either_x` reaches extern-choices.tn's `( a | b )`, two records sharing a class, so the choice is not disjoint
    and an untagged value selects no variant, whichever variant's fields it carries: a validation error at the
    field. The tag that selects one is an extern of the variant, `!a_x`.
    """
  error: {
    category: validation
    path: "/e"
  }
}
